  "content": "<p>在使用此模组之前，请先观看教程视频。您只能通过浏览器配置此模组（分配快捷键除外）。这是 Minecraft 模组开发中不寻常的做法，如果没有视频指导，您可能会感到困惑。简而言之，您必须在浏览器中打开 http://localhost:5005/ 以访问模组设置（同时游戏需加载该模组运行）。</p>\n<p>此模组仅限客户端使用。</p>\n<p>由于 CurseForge 严格的自动化 jar 包检查，此模组提供两个版本：一个带有 <code>-cf</code> 后缀，另一个没有。带有 <code>-cf</code> 后缀的版本是获得 CurseForge 批准的构建版本，但存在一些限制（例如，<code>os.exec</code> API 方法被禁用）。如果您想要不受这些限制的完整版本，可以从 GitHub 下载。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YrLeLA9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>观看视频以查看模组的实际效果。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9dA_siJT2U8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9dA_siJT2U8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zb_sFlW4DL0\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1niobYfF_68\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oM0kCHeEADM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/T-zWixIGqIM\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LEQ27z6Akus\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yXHRLlP7gtc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2IkLDRInTOc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>世界下载：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uyBNwlWk6fI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uyBNwlWk6fI</a></p>\n<p>拍卖自动化：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTfyy0-DHfg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTfyy0-DHfg</a></p>\n<p>基岩破坏者：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cZJAPMoI0dU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cZJAPMoI0dU</a></p>",
